#: src/components/ai/data-use-note.tsx
msgid "OpenAI says data sent to its API isn't used to train its models unless you opt in, and it keeps abuse-monitoring logs for up to 30 days."
msgstr "OpenAI oplyser, at data sendt til API'et ikke bruges til at træne deres modeller, medmindre du vælger det til, og at logfiler til misbrugsovervågning gemmes i op til 30 dage."

#: src/components/ai/data-use-note.tsx
msgid "Anthropic says it doesn't use API inputs or outputs to train its models by default, and deletes them within 30 days unless its usage policy or the law needs them kept longer."
msgstr "Anthropic oplyser, at API-input og -output som standard ikke bruges til at træne deres modeller og slettes inden for 30 dage, medmindre brugspolitikken eller loven kræver længere opbevaring."

#: src/components/ai/data-use-note.tsx
msgid "Google says that on the Gemini API's paid tier it doesn't use your prompts or responses to improve its products, and logs them for a limited time to catch misuse. On the free tier it uses them to improve its products, and people may read them."
msgstr "Google oplyser, at betalt Gemini API ikke bruger dine prompts eller svar til at forbedre produkter og gemmer dem kortvarigt for at opdage misbrug. På gratisniveauet bruges de til produktforbedring, og mennesker kan læse dem."

#: src/components/ai/data-use-note.tsx
msgid "OpenRouter says it logs only the time, the model and token counts, not prompts or responses unless you opt in, and sends requests to providers that log or train on them only if you allow it in its privacy settings."
msgstr "OpenRouter oplyser, at de kun logger tidspunkt, model og tokenantal, ikke prompts eller svar, medmindre du vælger det til, og kun sender til udbydere, der logger eller træner på dem, hvis du tillader det i privatlivsindstillingerne."

#: src/components/ai/data-use-note.tsx
msgid "Groq says it doesn't keep inference requests by default, may keep logs for up to 30 days to fix failures or investigate abuse, and isn't permitted to train on them without your permission."
msgstr "Groq oplyser, at forespørgsler som standard ikke gemmes, at logfiler kan gemmes i op til 30 dage til fejlfinding eller undersøgelse af misbrug, og at træning på dem kræver din tilladelse."

